{
  "title": "Reshape the Matrix",
  "difficulty": "Easy",
  "type": "matrix",
  "tags": [
    "Array",
    "Matrix",
    "Simulation"
  ],
  "description": "Reshape a matrix into a new matrix with r rows and c columns, maintaining original row-traversal order.",
  "target": [
    2,
    4
  ],
  "pseudocode": "1. if (r*c != m*n) return original;\n2. let res = new matrix[r][c];\n3. let count = 0;\n4. for i from 0 to m-1:\n5.   for j from 0 to n-1:\n6.     res[count / c][count % c] = mat[i][j];\n7.     count++;\n8. return res;",
  "steps": [
